<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-monolith-doom" category="High Gain" order="120" instrument="guitar" style="Doom">
  <description>Slow, massive doom: a woolly sustaining fuzz into a big British valve head with the bass high and the treble rolled back, through a closed 4x12 in a large room. Thick, dark and crushing; tune to C or lower, hit a chord and let it ring and feed back.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Doom</tag><tag>Fuzz</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Downtuned</tag><tag>Slow</tag><tag>Room</tag></tags>
  <sources>
